1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,855
Batter Up answered in one day.

2
00:00:01,855 --> 00:00:08,994
Twenty-two point five nine million views in twenty-four hours — a record for any K-pop group debut, ever.

3
00:00:08,994 --> 00:00:11,585
One hundred million in eighteen days.

4
00:00:11,585 --> 00:00:18,182
The channel kept setting speed limits: fastest girl group to a million subscribers, fastest to two.

5
00:00:18,182 --> 00:00:19,961
The machine worked perfectly.

6
00:00:19,961 --> 00:00:27,487
And the entire time, the fastest-growing comment section on every upload was a countdown to a name that wasn't there.

